# Local-only — Railway's dashboard is where real values for these live;
# .env.local never leaving the host it was created on is what keeps a
# secret (there currently aren't any NEXT_PUBLIC_* ones, but the habit
# matters more than today's contents) from ending up baked into an
# image or pushed anywhere alongside one.
